config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBJPEG62
	bool "libjpeg62 (libjpeg-turbo, 6.2 ABI)"
	depends on !BR2_STATIC_LIBS
	help
	  libjpeg.so.62 alongside the system libjpeg.so.8. Buildroot's
	  jpeg-turbo is always built with the 8 ABI; prebuilt binaries
	  linked against Debian's libjpeg62-turbo need the 6.2 one.

	  Same jpeg-turbo source and version; only the shared library
	  is installed, never headers, so nothing in the build links it.

	  https://libjpeg-turbo.org/

comment "libjpeg62 needs a toolchain w/ dynamic library"
	depends on BR2_STATIC_LIBS
